  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main0010_rival_04",
      "hash": "53625bfae0fb9c85",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]：打扰了～！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main0010_rival_05",
      "hash": "53625afae0fb9ad2",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "喂！[VAR TRNAME(0000)]！\\n我要上去咯！"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main0010_rival_01",
      "hash": "536256fae0fb9406",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]：[VAR TRNAME(0000)]，\\n你早！"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main0010_rival_08",
      "hash": "53625ffae0fba351",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……怎么了？\\n一脸搞不清楚状况的表情……"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main0010_rival_02",
      "hash": "536255fae0fb9253",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我实在是等不及了，\\n所以就来接你啦！\\c\\n今天终于到来了！\\n我们总算可以……\\c\\n从大木博士那里\\n拿到宝可梦，\\r\\n成为[VAR COLOR(0006)]训练家[VAR COLOR(0000)]了！\\c\\n我们现在就出发吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main0010_rival_06",
      "hash": "536259fae0fb991f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "啊，不过在出发前……"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main0010_rival_07",
      "hash": "536258fae0fb976c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我昨天给[VAR TRNAME(0000)]你\\n发了一封邮件！\\c\\n要是你还没看的话，\\n出发前记得先看一下哦！"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main0010_rival_03",
      "hash": "536254fae0fb90a0",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "那我就先去\\n大木博士的研究所等你咯！"
    }
  ],
